{"seq":2,"slug":"the-foundations-of-ai","title":"人工智能的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/computing-and-intelligence/the-foundations-of-ai","wordCount":2002,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"人工智能的奠基\">人工智能的奠基</h1><p>图灵被广泛称为&quot;人工智能之父&quot;，但这一称号背后是一组可考的具体贡献，而非空泛的赞颂。本篇梳理图灵的著作——尤其一九五〇年的《计算机器与智能》——<strong>作为一门学科起点</strong>的确切意义：它提供了什么问题、什么判据、什么研究路线，又为何在他身后才长成&quot;人工智能&quot;这门学科。</p>\n<p>注意分工：一九五〇年论文的文本细节见 <a href=\"the-1950-paper\">一九五〇年的论文</a>，测试机制见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/machine-intelligence/the-imitation-game\">图灵测试</a>。本篇只谈&quot;奠基&quot;这件事本身——图灵的工作如何变成后来 AI 研究的初始坐标系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇的核心论断：<strong>&quot;奠基&quot;不是发明一个词，而是提供一门学科起步所必需的三件硬通货——可操作判据、可行路线，以及它们赖以成立的通用计算证明。</strong> 三者的分工是：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>通用计算的证明</strong>说明机器原则上能做任何计算，为&quot;机器智能&quot;排除了物理上的不可能性。第二，<strong>可操作的判据</strong>（模仿游戏）回答了&quot;何时算成功&quot;，把成败变成可判、可测的事。第三，<strong>可行的研究路线</strong>（学习而非编程）给出下一步该往哪走，使研究不至于停在哲学清谈上。</p>\n<p>有了这三件，一门学科才有坐标系。这也解释了为什么奠基的功劳归于图灵而非更早的人：巴贝奇有机器构想却无通用性证明，笛卡尔有哲学发问却无可操作判据。同时须守一条分寸：图灵提供的是<strong>初始坐标，而非全部建筑</strong>——把学科落地的是达特茅斯一代，&quot;思想奠基者&quot;与&quot;建制创立者&quot;是两种不同角色。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可奠基性</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mtext>通用计算的证明</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>原则上可做</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>可操作的判据</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>何时算成功</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>可行的研究路线</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>学习而非编程</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可奠基性} = \\underbrace{\\text{通用计算的证明}}_{\\text{原则上可做}} + \\underbrace{\\text{可操作的判据}}_{\\text{何时算成功}} + \\underbrace{\\text{可行的研究路线}}_{\\text{学习而非编程}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可奠基性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">原则上可做</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通用计算的证明</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">何时算成功</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可操作的判据</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">学习而非编程</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可行的研究路线</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[通用计算证明&lt;br/&gt;机器原则上可做任何计算] --&gt; D[一门学科的初始坐标系]&#10;    B[可操作判据&lt;br/&gt;模仿游戏回答何时算成功] --&gt; D&#10;    C[可行研究路线&lt;br/&gt;学习而非编程] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[从哲学清谈转为可推进的工程纲领]&#10;    D --&gt; F[但只是初始坐标&lt;br/&gt;非全部建筑]\">flowchart TD\n    A[通用计算证明&lt;br/&gt;机器原则上可做任何计算] --&gt; D[一门学科的初始坐标系]\n    B[可操作判据&lt;br/&gt;模仿游戏回答何时算成功] --&gt; D\n    C[可行研究路线&lt;br/&gt;学习而非编程] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[从哲学清谈转为可推进的工程纲领]\n    D --&gt; F[但只是初始坐标&lt;br/&gt;非全部建筑]</pre><h2 id=\"一门学科的诞生时间线\">一门学科的诞生时间线</h2><p>&quot;人工智能&quot;这个词并非图灵所创——它由约翰·麦卡锡为一九五六年的达特茅斯研讨会（Dartmouth Workshop）所造，该会通常被视为 AI 作为独立学科的正式起点（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dartmouth_workshop\">Wikipedia: Dartmouth workshop</a>）。图灵的角色是<strong>思想上的先行者</strong>：他在学科有名字之前，就已写下它的核心问题与判据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;  title 人工智能奠基的关键节点&#10;  1936 : 通用图灵机 : 论证机器可模拟任意计算&#10;  1948 : 《智能机器》报告 : 图灵未发表的内部报告,已含神经网络雏形&#10;  1950 : 《计算机器与智能》 : 提出模仿游戏与学习机器&#10;  1956 : 达特茅斯研讨会 : &quot;人工智能&quot;一词诞生,学科正式成立\">timeline\n  title 人工智能奠基的关键节点\n  1936 : 通用图灵机 : 论证机器可模拟任意计算\n  1948 : 《智能机器》报告 : 图灵未发表的内部报告,已含神经网络雏形\n  1950 : 《计算机器与智能》 : 提出模仿游戏与学习机器\n  1956 : 达特茅斯研讨会 : \"人工智能\"一词诞生,学科正式成立</pre><p>特别值得一提的是一九四八年图灵为英国国家物理实验室（NPL）撰写的内部报告《智能机器》（Intelligent Machinery）。它当时未公开发表，却已构想了&quot;非组织化机器&quot;（unorganised machines）——一种可通过训练改变连接的网络，被后世视为人工神经网络与连接主义的早期雏形（来源：<a href=\"https://www.turing.org.uk/scrapbook/test.html\">The Turing Digital Archive / Alan Turing: The Enigma</a>）。这份报告说明图灵的 AI 思想远早于、也远广于那篇广为人知的 1950 年论文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三项可考的奠基贡献\">三项可考的奠基贡献</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>贡献</th>\n<th>出处</th>\n<th>它给 AI 留下了什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>把&quot;机器能否思考&quot;转译为可操作判据</td>\n<td>1950 论文</td>\n<td>一个可证伪、可工程化的研究目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提出&quot;学习机器 / 儿童机器&quot;路线</td>\n<td>1950 论文 §7</td>\n<td>机器学习范式的雏形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构想可训练的网络结构</td>\n<td>1948《智能机器》报告</td>\n<td>连接主义 / 神经网络雏形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三项贡献共享一条方法论主线——<strong>用简单、可精确描述的规则去解释复杂行为</strong>，这条主线贯穿图灵的全部工作，详见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>。在 AI 语境下它具体化为：与其追问&quot;智能是什么&quot;这种本质问题，不如设计可观测的行为判据与可训练的机制，让智能&quot;涌现&quot;而非&quot;定义&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是图灵-而非更早的人\">为什么是图灵，而非更早的人</h2><p>机器智能的幻想由来已久（从中世纪的机械人到巴贝奇的分析机），为什么奠基的功劳归于图灵？关键在于他提供了别人没有的<strong>三件硬通货</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可奠基性</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mtext>通用计算的证明</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>机器原则上能做任何计算</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>可操作的判据</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>何时算&quot;成功&quot;</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>可行的研究路线</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>学习而非编程</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可奠基性} = \\underbrace{\\text{通用计算的证明}}_{\\text{机器原则上能做任何计算}} + \\underbrace{\\text{可操作的判据}}_{\\text{何时算&quot;成功&quot;}} + \\underbrace{\\text{可行的研究路线}}_{\\text{学习而非编程}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可奠基性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">机器原则上能做任何计算</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通用计算的证明</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0174em;vertical-align:-1.3341em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">何时算</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">成功</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">&quot;</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可操作的判据</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">学习而非编程</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可行的研究路线</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>巴贝奇有机器构想却无&quot;通用性&quot;的证明；笛卡尔有&quot;机器能否有理性&quot;的哲学发问却无可操作判据。图灵第一个把&quot;机器能思考吗&quot;从哲学清谈或工程幻想，变成一个<strong>有定义、有判据、有路线</strong>的研究纲领——这正是&quot;奠基&quot;的实质。洛夫莱斯夫人曾断言机器&quot;只能做我们命令它做的事&quot;，图灵的学习机器路线正是对这一断言的正面反驳（见 <a href=\"the-1950-paper\">一九五〇年的论文</a> 第六节）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"当代回响-图灵的预测与今天的-ai\">当代回响：图灵的预测与今天的 AI</h2><p>图灵 1950 年预测&quot;约 2000 年机器可在五分钟问答中使提问者判对率不超 70%&quot;。以今天的眼光看：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>形式上的&quot;通过&quot;早已发生。</strong> 现代大语言模型在短对话中已能让相当比例的人误判，从纯行为判据看，图灵的工程预测大体兑现。</li>\n<li><strong>但&quot;理解&quot;之争未平息。</strong> 塞尔的&quot;中文房间&quot;质疑——行为上的模仿不等于真正的理解——在大模型时代反而更尖锐：模型能流畅对答，是否就&quot;懂&quot;？</li>\n<li><strong>学习机器路线全面胜出。</strong> 图灵押注的&quot;学习而非手工编程&quot;，正是当今深度学习的核心范式；而符号主义的手工规则路线在多数任务上已退居其次。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"权衡-争议与反模式\">权衡、争议与反模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>权衡：行为判据 vs 内部机制。</strong> 图灵选择只看行为（输出），回避了无法验证的内部状态（意识）。代价是&quot;通过测试&quot;无法保证&quot;真正理解&quot;；回报是 AI 得以成为可推进的工程学科而非哲学僵局。</li>\n<li><strong>争议：&quot;人工智能之父&quot;是否过誉？</strong> 麦卡锡、明斯基、纽厄尔、司马贺等达特茅斯一代才是把学科落地的人；图灵更应称为<strong>思想奠基者</strong>而非建制创立者。两种说法并不矛盾。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式一：把图灵测试当成 AI 的终点线。</strong> 它只是一个操作性判据，连图灵本人都未视其为智能的充分定义。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式二：忽视 1948 报告而只记 1950 论文。</strong> 这会让人误以为图灵的 AI 思想只有&quot;测试&quot;；事实上他的连接主义构想同样深远。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式三：把&quot;奠基&quot;读成&quot;独力创立&quot;。</strong> 学科是一代人的集体成果，图灵提供的是初始坐标，而非全部建筑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>&quot;人工智能&quot;一词由麦卡锡为 1956 年达特茅斯研讨会所造；图灵的角色是学科有名字之前的思想先行者。</li>\n<li>他的奠基贡献有三项：可操作的判据（1950 论文）、学习机器路线（§7）、可训练网络构想（1948《智能机器》报告）。</li>\n<li>&quot;奠基&quot;的实质是提供三件硬通货——通用计算的证明、可操作的判据、可行的研究路线。</li>\n<li>与巴贝奇（有构想无通用性证明）、笛卡尔（有发问无可操作判据）相比，图灵第一个把问题变成有定义、有判据、有路线的纲领。</li>\n<li>应守的分寸：图灵提供初始坐标而非全部建筑，称为&quot;思想奠基者&quot;较&quot;建制创立者&quot;更准确。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：图灵作为学科创立者的整体评价见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/founding-ai/the-turing-test\">创立人工智能</a>；测试机制见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/machine-intelligence/the-imitation-game\">图灵测试</a>；学习机器思想见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/machine-intelligence/learning-machines\">会学习的机器</a>；图灵思想的长远影响见 <a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/shaping-the-digital-age/the-information-revolution\">信息革命</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考来源\">参考来源</h2><ul>\n<li>Wikipedia，Dartmouth workshop（学科正式起点）：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dartmouth_workshop\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dartmouth_workshop</a></li>\n<li>论文全文（牛津大学 IEG e-library）：<a href=\"https://www.cs.ox.ac.uk/activities/ieg/e-library/sources/t_article.pdf\">https://www.cs.ox.ac.uk/activities/ieg/e-library/sources/t_article.pdf</a></li>\n<li>Alan Turing: The Enigma / Turing Digital Archive（1948《智能机器》报告）：<a href=\"https://www.turing.org.uk/scrapbook/test.html\">https://www.turing.org.uk/scrapbook/test.html</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"人工智能的奠基","id":"人工智能的奠基"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一门学科的诞生时间线","id":"一门学科的诞生时间线"},{"level":2,"text":"三项可考的奠基贡献","id":"三项可考的奠基贡献"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是图灵，而非更早的人","id":"为什么是图灵-而非更早的人"},{"level":2,"text":"当代回响：图灵的预测与今天的 AI","id":"当代回响-图灵的预测与今天的-ai"},{"level":2,"text":"权衡、争议与反模式","id":"权衡-争议与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考来源","id":"参考来源"}],"prev":{"title":"一九五〇年的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/computing-and-intelligence/the-1950-paper"},"next":{"title":"战时的密码破译","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/other-contributions/wartime-cryptanalysis"}}